    # you "Well, my lady, I apologize for barging in like this... I was told about this place and wanted to meet with the guild for a deal."
    you "好吧,我的小姐,我为闯进来道歉...我听说过这个地方,想和你们合作。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2322
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_7d433ae3:

    # you "I swear my intentions were only about spying, stealing and robbing. Nothing dishonourable."
    you "我发誓,我的目的只是打探消息、偷窃和抢劫,这些没有什么不光彩的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2324
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_10dee7a2:

    # renza "That's what you say... Who are you?"
    renza "这就是你说的...你是谁?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2326
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_9a368c58:

    # you "My name is [MC.name]. I'm the owner of [brothel.name], which I received from a guy named Gio..."
    you "我是[MC.name]。我是从乔那里接手了[brothel.name]我现在是那的老板..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2328
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_e8c0a1a8:

    # renza "Gio? That old fart? I don't like to hear the name of a competitor in my own house... Maybe I should have slit your throat, after all."
    renza "乔?那老混蛋?我可不喜欢在自己的地盘上听到死对头的名字...也许我应该干脆割开你的喉咙。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2330
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_d8a01b0d:

    # you "...Gio, that disgusting, annoying freeloader, of course. I disliked him at first sight, hahaha!"
    you "...那个讨厌、烦人的寄生虫乔,谁不讨厌他呢。我一看见他就反胃,哈哈哈!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2332
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_b2875e1a:

    # renza "That's more like it."
    renza "既然这样那我们还有的聊。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2334
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_185b3160:

    # renza "..."
    renza "..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2336
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_4d6a37a0:

    # renza "So, you're a brothel owner, uh? This kind of connections can have its uses..."
    renza "所以你是个青楼的老板,嗯?和你合作也有点好处..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2338
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_fd92b114:

    # "She takes a closer look at you."
    "她仔细地打量着你。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2342
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_96b84e59:

    # renza "A strong build, various scars, a keen eye for weapons..."
    renza "健壮的体格,一身的伤疤,对武器敏锐的眼光..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2344
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_eaaf631d:

    # renza "You're a warrior, aren't you?"
    renza "你是个战士,对吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2348
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_d9b7a7c1:

    # renza "Dandy manners, hands that look like they've never gotten dirty, the smell of sulfur on your clothes..."
    renza "优雅的举止,纤细的双手,衣服上散发着硫磺的气味..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2350
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_5f4321f2:

    # renza "You're a mage, aren't you?"
    renza "你是个法师,对吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2354
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_a08916f1:

    # renza "A slick tongue, deft hands, a sneaky look about you..."
    renza "油滑的舌头,灵活的双手,狡猾的表情..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2356
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_06395e00:

    # renza "You're a camel dung salesman, aren't you?" with vpunch
    renza "你是卖骆驼粪的，对吧？" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2358
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_ff2fef5e:

    # you "What?!?"
    you "什么?!?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2360
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_6208ba76:

    # renza "...or a trader of sorts."
    renza "...又或者是其他什么商人。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2362
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_686cb50a:

    # renza "And a somewhat handsome one, at that. *wink*"
    renza "而且还有些英俊。*眨眼*"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2364
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_08b5eed0:

    # "If your situation wasn't so dire, you would be blushing."
    "如果不是你现在的处境这么艰难,此刻肯定已经满脸通红了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2366
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_3134f596:

    # renza "Maybe we {i}could{/i} do business. But you must understand and accept my rules, first."
    renza "也许我们{i}可以{/i}合作。但是你必须先明白并接受我的规矩。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2368
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_e86e41a7:

    # you "Well, I've come this far..."
    you "既然来都来了..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2370
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_46420946:

    # renza "If I decide to let you live, you are never to tell anyone about me, or the location of this place. You mustn't brag about your connection to us, or otherwise reveal it to anyone."
    renza "如果我决定放你一条生路,你永远不能告诉任何人关于我的事,或者透露这个地方的位置。你不能吹嘘你和我们的关系,也不能向任何人透露。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2373
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_ed6e05cf:

    # renza "The penalty for betrayal is a dagger to the neck. Are we clear?"
    renza "背叛的代价就是脖子上这把刀。明白吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2375
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_1a71e18f:

    # you "... "
    you "... "

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2377
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_15d6b866:

    # you "Yes."
    you "是的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2379
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_de94f26a:

    # renza "As long as we're doing business, you must understand the risks. The Guard is hunting us down, and if they catch you as an accomplice, you'll rot in a cell, be sent off to the pit, or worse."
    renza "和我们合作,你得明白其中的风险。军队正在追捕我们,如果他们发现你是同谋,你要么在牢房里腐烂,要么被送去矿坑,要么更糟。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2382
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_ed3f4d1c:

    # renza "I'm working to get them off our back, but trust me, it's hard. They don't like us treading on their own turf."
    renza "我正努力甩开他们,但是相信我,这很难。他们不喜欢我们踩到他们的地盘上。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2384
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_b0ecb5e5:

    # you "I see."
    you "我明白了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2386
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_0d3348c3:

    # renza "In return, I'll give you access to some of our merchandise. It's stuff that, err, fell off the back of a cart, so to speak."
    renza "作为回报,我会让你接触到我们的一些特产。这些东西,呃,可以说是从货车上自己掉下来的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2388
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_1c5711a4:

    # renza "As long as we're dealing, you'll buy what's here at face value, and there is no refund. I don't wanna hear any complaints, understood?"
    renza "和我们合作,你就要按定价购买这里的商品,概不退货。我可不想听任何抱怨,明白吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2390
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_b84dc7d7:

    # you "Fine."
    you "好的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2392
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_6d7e476d:

    # "She seems to relax."
    "她似乎放松下来了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2394
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_d09a9c97:

    # renza "Very well, then. As long as we understand each other and you keep your side of the deal, you can come here once a week. I'll have an item for sale, for a bargain price compared to regular item shops."
    renza "很好。只要我们互相理解,你遵守规矩,你可以每周来这里一次。我会以跳楼价出售一些商品。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2397
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_592e2b93:

    # you "Sounds good."
    you "听上去不错。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2401
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_4ff1eca2:

    # renza "But don't even think about double-crossing me!"
    renza "但是别想着出卖我!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2403
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_6f4aacdd:

    # "She gives you a killer stare."
    "她的眼神好像能把你吃掉。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2405
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_030dd4bd:

    # you "No... No Ma'am!"
    you "不...不,女士!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2407
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_f7402f62:

    # renza "Perfect. Looking forward to doing business with you."
    renza "很好。期待与你的合作。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2409
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_bc50d29f:

    # you "Thank you, my lady."
    you "谢谢您,女士。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2411
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_5f424013:

    # renza "Call me Renza. Oh, and don't forget... I am doing you a favour. I will expect it repaid some day."
    renza "叫我伦萨吧。哦,别忘了...我是在帮你的忙。有朝一日,我会要求你回报我的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2413
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_846e86e7:

    # "You're not sure what she means by that."
    "你不确定她的话中有何深意。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2415
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_ed12f364:

    # you "S... Sure."
    you "好...好的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2421
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_5e7795a3:

    # "You leave the guild unharmed. Renza teaches you the password, so you can enter without causing a brawl, next time."
    "你安然离开了公会。伦萨教你了通行口令,下次就不会引起误会了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2423
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_9b17ee6e:

    # you "That went well. Throat unslit, and all."
    you "进展顺利。喉咙也没被割。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2425
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_3d709fa4:

    # you "Damn, that Renza is cute... A little scary, and a little bossy, but man, those boobs..."
    you "该死,这个伦萨真可爱...有点吓人,有点爱发号施令,不过那对椒乳..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2429
translate chinese_simplified c1_thieves_guild_found_38b500b6:

    # "You can now visit the {b}thieves guild{/b}."
    "你现在可以拜访{b}盗贼公会{/b}了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2451
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_7af4e877:

    # "Returning to the old house in the slum, you see the now familiar thieves symbol etched on the door."
    "回到贫民窟里的那栋老房子时,你看到熟悉的盗贼标志刻在门上。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2453
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_6ae7f845:

    # "After checking that no guards are lurking about, you cautiously walk up to the entrance."
    "确认没有守卫在附近徘徊后,你小心翼翼地走近门口。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2455
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_0fc18a4c:

    # "You find the door solidly locked."
    "你发现门被牢牢锁住了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2458
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_2d52323e:

    # you "How should I go on about this?" nointeract
    you "我该如何继续处理这件事？" nointeract

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2462
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_a2bf925d:

    # you "To hell with discretion, I need answers."
    you "讨厌这种谨慎的做法,我需要立刻得到答案。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2466
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_31b4acf6:

    # "Grabbing a rusty iron bar from a pile of rubble, you use it as a lever to break the lock."
    "你从一堆残骼中拿起一根生锈的铁棒,用它撬开门锁。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2468
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_ede6d567:

    # you "HUUUMPH!"
    you "哼！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2474
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_a1d3f1e4:

    # "Piling all your strength on the lever, you hear a satisfying crack as the lock snaps open."
    "你用尽全力用力撬动,听到一声令人满意的喀嚓声,锁头应声断裂。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2478
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_acbb1a69:

    # "The door hinges open, revealing the dark entrance hall of the old house."
    "门被撬开了,老房子的黑暗大厅出现在你眼前。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2480
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_a8134277:

    # "With all the racket you made, you'd be surprised if no one heard you coming. You step in."
    "制造了这么大动静,如果没人听到才怪。你走了进去。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2484
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_5206f15d:

    # you "Running inside weapons blazing seems like a bad idea. Let's look for another entrance."
    you "闯进去挥舞武器似乎不是个好主意。我们再找个别的入口吧。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2488
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_ec9d3641:

    # "After circling around the house, you finally notice a half-open skylight."
    "在房子周围绕了一圈后,你终于注意到一扇半开的天窗。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2490
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_d8794968:

    # you "Let's try to climb in through there."
    you "我们试着从那里翻进去吧。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2492
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_0f3a37dc:

    # "Taking care not to make noise, you climb on top of the old house, taking advantage of the numerous cracks in the wall."
    "小心不发出任何声响,你踩着墙上的裂缝攀爬到房顶。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2496
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_c00a79f3:

    # "Opening the skylight completely, you let yourself slide down to the floor of the old house, with as little noise as you can manage."
    "打开天窗,你轻捷地滑了下去,落到了地板上。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2504
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_0e4fed89:

    # you "Alright, I'm in."
    you "好的,我进来了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2508
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_bc7c977a:

    # "The house is dark, but as your eyes adjust to the darkness, you can see a ray of light filtering from a piece of flooring in the middle of the room."
    "房子里很暗,但是当你的双眼适应黑暗时,你能看到一条从房间中央的地板上渗透出来的光线。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2510
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_cd488578:

    # "Upon closer examination, you find a trapdoor, and you can hear the echo of voices coming from underneath."
    "仔细查看,你发现了一个暗门,并且能听到从下面传来阵阵回声。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2512
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_cfdbe49e:

    # you "Let's go in."
    you "让我进去看看。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2514
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_62d160c3:

    # "Lifting the trapdoor, you see a ladder leading down to a torchlit basement."
    "掀开暗门,你看到一架梯子通向一个火把照亮的地下室。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2516
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_b7d5db0c:

    # "There is no way but down. You sheath your weapon, and step down the ladder."
    "只能往下走了。你收起武器,踩上梯子。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2522
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_f9c05907:

    # "Reaching the bottom of the ladder without raising alarms, you hone in on the source of the voices."
    "安静地到达梯子底部,你集中注意力去查找声音的来源。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2524
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_43e9a978:

    # "At the end of the corridor is a door. Female voices can be heard on the other side."
    "走廊尽头有一扇门,从里面传来女性的谈话声。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2533
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_624812a4:

    # lieutenant "Do you realize the risks I had to take to go this far? We must take action {b}now{/b}!"
    lieutenant "你知道不知道我走到这一步需要承担多大的风险?我们必须{b}立即{/b}采取行动!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2540
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_19dbbf90:

    # renza "I appreciate it, acolyte, I really do."
    renza "我很感激你,副会长,我真的很感激。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2542
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_c7c832e2:

    # you "(Acolyte???)"
    you "(副会长???)"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2544
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_ba426b06:

    # renza "But surely, you can't suggest we take over the Guard headquarters by storm... It will be a bloodbath, and I'm not sure we'd end up on the surviving side."
    renza "但是你肯定不能建议我们以武力攻占军队总部...那会血流成河,我们恐怕难逃一死。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2546
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_42a348ee:

    # lieutenant "I know! But we have the prisoners, surely we can use them to get some leverage. Captain Farah must have a weakness..."
    lieutenant "我知道!但是我们有很多囚犯,我们可以利用他们来施加压力。法拉上尉一定有弱点..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2552
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_f204e479:

    # you "(Are they plotting to take on the Guard captain? I can't hear well...)"
    you "(他们在策划谋反上尉吗?我听不太清楚...)"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2554
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_a0d56e67:

    # "You move closer to the door, pressing your ear against it in an effort to hear better."
    "你靠近门,把耳朵贴上去努力听清里面的对话。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2558
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_38ff5e10:

    # lieutenant "What was that?" with vpunch
    lieutenant "那是什么？" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2560
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_4083dfa7:

    # you "Shit!"
    you "糟糕!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2562
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_2e104261:

    # "Stepping back from the door, you don't have time to think about an escape plan before it slams open."
    "你从门边退开,来不及想逃脱之策,门就猛地打开了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2569
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_677f13f5:

    # lieutenant "You!"
    lieutenant "是你!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2571
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_9ab0485d:

    # you "Wait! I can explain..."
    you "等等!让我解释..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2573
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_140a6901:

    # lieutenant "Shut up. Come with me."
    lieutenant "闭嘴。跟我来。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2576
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_20e8af52:

    # "You reach the bottom of the ladder, only to feel the cold point of a blade against your back."
    "你到达梯子底部,却感觉到背后抵着一把冰冷的利刃。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2580
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_0b72e547:

    # lieutenant "Easy, there, pimp. Came to join the party?"
    lieutenant "小心点,小子。你以为你是来参加派对吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2582
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_283bbbdd:

    # "You turn around slowly."
    "你慢慢转过身去。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2584
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_f1c3d439:

    # you "Lieutenant. I expected to find you in here."
    you "中尉。我就知道你在这。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2586
