# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3363
translate chinese_simplified c1_sergeant_interrogation_5a6d45ac:

    # you "...I could make you obey me with a spell..."
    you "...我也可以用咒语让你听话..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3365
translate chinese_simplified c1_sergeant_interrogation_e4786f39:

    # "She looks at you with disdain, but she seems a little less self-assured. She's the warrior-type, and most warriors are uncomfortable around magic."
    "她带着轻蔑的眼神看着你,但似乎有些不太自信了。她是个战士,大多数战士都不太擅长应付魔法。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3367
translate chinese_simplified c1_sergeant_interrogation_fbac927b:

    # you "...or I could just fuck your brains out."
    you "...或者我可以操到让你的大脑爽翻。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3371
translate chinese_simplified c1_sergeant_interrogation_92367af8:

    # sergeant "What?!?"
    sergeant "什么?!?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3373
translate chinese_simplified c1_sergeant_interrogation_3cad1d46:

    # "She wasn't expecting that. For a fleeting moment, you could see real panic in her eyes, but she quickly got a hold of herself."
    "她没有料到会是这样。你瞥见她眼中一闪而过的真正恐慌,不过她很快就重新控制住了自己。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3375
translate chinese_simplified c1_sergeant_interrogation_30741861:

    # you "What is it? Does the thought of a dick up your cunt make you uncomfortable?"
    you "怎么了?难道被插的主意让你感到不舒服吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3377
translate chinese_simplified c1_sergeant_interrogation_82608d27:

    # sergeant "Grrr... That's disgusting! I would never..." with vpunch
    sergeant "呃……真恶心！我绝对不会……" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3379
translate chinese_simplified c1_sergeant_interrogation_28c25643:

    # you "What's the matter, Sergeant? You're blushing... Don't tell me... Are you a virgin?"
    you "怎么了,中士?你脸红了...别告诉我...你还是个处女?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3381
translate chinese_simplified c1_sergeant_interrogation_f1af6424:

    # "Her face is bright red now. She snaps."
    "她的脸现在通红。她暴怒地说道:"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3383
translate chinese_simplified c1_sergeant_interrogation_b99a9b6f:

    # sergeant "I'll kill you, motherfucker! I'll gut you like a fish! *mad*" with vpunch
    sergeant "我要杀了你，你这混蛋！我要把你开膛破肚，像剖鱼一样！*愤怒*" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3385
translate chinese_simplified c1_sergeant_interrogation_81534bf2:

    # you "I see... My guess was right..."
    you "原来如此...看来我猜对了..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3387
translate chinese_simplified c1_sergeant_interrogation_7931776d:

    # "She yanks forward, looking set to murder you with her bare hands. You're thankful for the chains holding her back."
    "她猛地向你冲去,想用双手掐住你的脖子。幸好有铁链将她拽住。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3389
translate chinese_simplified c1_sergeant_interrogation_59d5f919:

    # sergeant "I'll kill you!"
    sergeant "我要杀了你!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3391
translate chinese_simplified c1_sergeant_interrogation_e559d3ce:

    # you "You're in a position to do no such a thing. In fact, you may not be alive when the sun rises tomorrow... And you may no longer be a virgin..."
    you "你现在什么也做不了。事实上,你可能看不到明天的太阳...不过至少你不再是个处女了..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3393
translate chinese_simplified c1_sergeant_interrogation_82a25cee:

    # sergeant "Die, you bastard! I'll slaughter you! Face me in a one-on-one fight!"
    sergeant "去死,你这个混蛋!我要杀了你!和我一对一地决斗!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3408
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_7fe74a97:

    # you "Come on, no need to lose your temper here... I'm sure we can come to an agreement."
    you "嘿,别这么生气嘛...我相信我们能精诚合作的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3410
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_7e6be936:

    # sergeant "Drop dead."
    sergeant "去死吧。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3418
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_6261410e:

    # you "Aren't you curious to know how we got you here?"
    you "你难道不好奇我们是如何把你带到这里的吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3420
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_1a62454a:

    # sergeant "Got me? Hmmpf, I was hot on the Lieutenant's trail, that scheming bitch... And I got careless. I should have brought men for backup. What of it?"
    sergeant "抓住我?哼,要不是我一直在跟踪中尉...才大意了。我应该叫上更多人手的。怎么了?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3422
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_5c077c4b:

    # you "Bwahaha, you're naive... That's very cute, coming from you."
    you "哈哈哈,你真是天真...真可爱,这话你也说得出口。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3424
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_8d70e6a0:

    # sergeant "What the fuck are you talking about? Free me and I'll show you who's cute, when you beg me to keep your body parts! Grrr..."
    sergeant "你在说些什么鬼话?赶快放了我,否则我会让你知道什么叫!  咬牙..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3426
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_4553c3a3:

    # you "You've been played for a fool, and you don't realize it. The captain set you up, you and the other officers."
    you "你被耍了,却还不自知。上尉设了圈套,骗了你和其他军官。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3428
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_5a38b011:

    # sergeant "What? You expect me to believe that crap?"
    sergeant "什么?你想让我相信这种鬼话?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3430
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_dd05eb50:

    # you "We have you in custody, as well as the lieutenant and another sergeant... The lieutenant is being interrogated right now, and quite roughly, I must say."
    you "我们把你,以及那个中尉和那个中士全都逮捕了...中尉正在接受严酷的审讯。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3432
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_60dac37a:

    # you "The other sergeant is rotting in a cell right next to yours. Her name is Maya. We'll deal with her soon."
    you "另一个中士正在和你关在同一个牢房里等死。她叫玛雅对吧。我们很快就会去处理她的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3434
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_7588dcc5:

    # sergeant "You're lying! Why would the captain..."
    sergeant "你在撒谎!为什么中尉会..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3436
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_1666dff0:

    # you "It's a purge, you idiot. The captain passed a deal with the thieves guild. They're going to work hand in hand from now on."
    you "这是一次大清洗,笨蛋。上尉和盗贼公会私下勾结。他们是一伙的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3438
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_06f10210:

    # you "But some of the officers in the Guard stood in the way of the captain's complete domination... So you were set up. A pretty clever plan, I must say."
    you "但是有些官员完全在上尉的统治之下...所以你们被设计了。真是一个聪明的计划,我必须说。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3440
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_229b8edf:

    # sergeant "That's... Impossible! I'm not like the others! I've always been loyal!"
    sergeant "这不可能!我不像其他人!我一直都很忠诚!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3442
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_27d9692c:

    # you "Loyal, but ambitious... Sooner or later you were going to want more power for yourself, weren't you?"
    you "忠诚,但是有野心...迟早你也会想要更多的权力,对吧?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3444
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_95afb44e:

    # sergeant "..."
    sergeant "..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3446
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_112e0330:

    # you "Weren't you?"
    you "对不对?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3448
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_544b81b8:

    # "You take a false look of pity as she looks increasingly lost and confused."
    "你装出一副同情的样子,看着她越来越迷茫和困惑。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3450
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_65f5b9b4:

    # you "You were expendable, Kashiv. You always were. The captain thought nothing of betraying you, just like the others."
    you "你是可替代的,卡希夫。一直都是。上尉不在乎抛弃你,就像抛弃其他人一样。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3452
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_d7b25c13:

    # "Real tears are flowing down her face, now. She looks hurt and vulnerable."
    "她的脸上流下了滚烫的泪水,看起来十分受伤和脆弱。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3454
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_74ceb9fc:

    # sergeant "I believed... Every word... I..."
    sergeant "我相信......你说的每句话...我..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3456
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_7626c549:

    # you "It's the captain who sent you on this 'errand', after the lieutenant, isn't it?"
    you "是上尉派你来跟踪中尉的,不是吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3458
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_83b9bf4d:

    # "You can see you guessed right."
    "看来你猜对了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3460
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_2256c6d6:

    # sergeant "I don't believe this... For years I was the captain's right hand... I thought..."
    sergeant "我不敢相信...多年来我一直是上尉的得力干将...我以为..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3462
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_f0d86024:

    # you "You gambled on the wrong horse, and you lost. There's nothing you can do now. Except..."
    you "你押错了宝,输了。现在你什么也做不了了。除非..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3464
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_1683717b:

    # "Looking up through her tears, she gives you an expectant look."
    "她抬头泪眼朦胧的看着你,带着期待的神情。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3466
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_cfa4e90b:

    # sergeant "Except?"
    sergeant "除非?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3468
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_dffe660e:

    # you "Well, you could get payback. I don't know if vengeance is your thing, but..."
    you "好吧,你可以报仇。我不知道你是否有这种想法,不过..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3470
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_6e2048c9:

    # "She clenches her fists with rage."
    "她紧握双拳,充满怒意。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3472
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_6b936ff4:

    # sergeant "Tell me. What can I do? I want payback. I {b}demand{/b} it!" with vpunch
    sergeant "告诉我，我该怎么办？我要报复！我要求报复！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3474
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_561b7c54:

    # "You smile. It seems you have lost nothing of your ability to play people like cithars."
    "你嘴角上扬。看来你依然拥有像演奏乐器般操纵他人的本领。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3476
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_60fde2ac:

    # you "Help me then. I'm looking for leverage against the Guard. Get some dirt on the captain, anything that could help."
    you "那就帮我一把。我正在寻找上尉的把柄。只要对她不利，什么情报都行。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3478
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_e05eaa02:

    # sergeant "What's it to you?"
    sergeant "关你什么事？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3480
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_df69bc9f:

    # you "Well, I can't say I'm too happy about this alliance between the Guard and the thieves guild. As a businessman, having a strong, all-powerful overlord doesn't sit very well with me. So I'm thinking of double-timing the guild."
    you "坦白的说,我并不为军队和盗贼公会的联盟感到高兴。作为一个商人,我不太喜欢面对一个强大且无所不能的统治者。所以我正在考虑背叛公会。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3483
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_8be3e3d5:

    # sergeant "Crooked and despicable. That sounds like you. But what are you gonna do with this information?"
    sergeant "真是卑鄙可耻。这倒像是你会做的事。但你打算用这些情报干什么？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3485
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_8be71968:

    # you "Blackmail. Arm-twisting. Perhaps, removing the captain altogether."
    you "勒索。施加压力。或者干脆除掉上尉。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3487
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_95afb44e_1:

    # sergeant "..."
    sergeant "..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3489
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_96aaf86a:

    # sergeant "I can help you. But you have to promise me one thing."
    sergeant "我可以帮你。但你必须答应我一件事。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3491
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_a577ad0e:

    # you "What?"
    you "什么?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3493
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_e4200337:

    # sergeant "Use this information to completely destroy the captain and the officers who betrayed me. Don't just kill them; drag their reputation through the mud, have their minds and their bodies broken, force them into slavery and hard labor..."
    sergeant "用这些情报彻底摧毁上尉和背叛我的上级。不仅要杀掉他们,还要玷污他们的名誉,折磨他们的身心,让他们沦为奴隶和苦力..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3495
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_cbe2f481:

    # sergeant "And when it's done, {b}I{/b} will find them, and I will kill them." with vpunch
    sergeant "事情结束后，我会找到他们，然后杀了他们。" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3497
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_c6979777:

    # "Her anger and hatred is painful to watch. Still, you're happy that you managed to get her to talk."
    "她的愤怒和仇恨令人不忍直视。不过,你很高兴她终于开口了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3503
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_3c6fba82:

    # you "Look, there's no need to make a fuss about this. I can get you released quickly if you cooperate."
    you "听着,没必要这么大惊小怪的。只要你配合,我可以还你自由之身。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3505
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_37f7840d:

    # sergeant "Bite my ass."
    sergeant "满嘴屁话。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3507
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_c08755bb:

    # you "You're not making it any easier for you, you know?"
    you "你这样只会让自己的处境更加不利。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3509
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_f43d51fa:

    # sergeant "Fuck off. You'll get nothing from me."
    sergeant "滚开。你什么也别想从我这问出来。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3511
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_d23e16a4:

    # "You argue and plead with her for long minutes, but you can't get anything out of her apart from threats and insults."
    "你花了很长时间争辩和恳求她,但除了威胁和侮辱,你什么也没得到。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3522
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_2588d6ab:

    # you "You're a piece of work, you know that? I'll have to make an example out of you."
    you "你真是个麻烦精,知道吗？我得好好教训教训你。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3524
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_0afde370:

    # sergeant "I'm not scared of you! Bring it on!"
    sergeant "我会怕你？!来啊,尽管来吧!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3528
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_c7a525a5:

    # you "I really don't want to hit a woman. But you leave me no choice."
    you "我真的不想动手打女人。是你逼我的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3532
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_e5a9a1ea:

    # you "All right, have it your way. Whatever it takes."
    you "好吧,那就随你的便。不管用什么方法。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3536
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_7ce50f34:

    # you "Great. Kicking bitches around is what I do for fun anyway."
    you "好极了,惩罚婊子正是我最喜欢的节目。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3548
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_7046db26:

    # "Before she can hurl another insult at you, you punch her with a vicious uppercut to the stomach." with vpunch
    "在她来得及再次辱骂你之前，你一记凶狠的上勾拳击中了她的腹部。" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3550
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_f58863aa:

    # sergeant "Ouch... Grrr..."
    sergeant "哎哟...该死的..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3562
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_5ee84444:

    # "Giving her no respite, you hit her until she's down." with vpunch
    "你不给她任何喘息的机会，一直打她直到她倒下。" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3566
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_1e5b83c6:

    # sergeant "Aaarh!"
    sergeant "啊啊啊!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3582
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_0aa7f51f:

    # "You kick her repeatedly, using the metal cap of your boots for maximum damage."
    "你用脚尖不停地踢打她,力求造成最大的伤害。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3589
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_1e5b83c6_1:

    # sergeant "Aaarh!"
    sergeant "啊啊啊!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3596
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_4060f72b:

    # sergeant "Ooooh..."
    sergeant "哦哦哦..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3598
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_ff65f53c:

    # "You keep going for long minutes, even after hearing the sound of her ribs cracking."
    "即使听到她肋骨断裂的声音,你也没有停下,一直继续打下去。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3600
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_277c3cc3:

    # you "Talk to me, now, sergeant! Talk to me!"
    you "你招不招!快说!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3602
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_83167d47:

    # sergeant "You bastard... Ooooh..."
    sergeant "你这个混蛋...嗷..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3604
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_c1c08378:

    # "She really is quite tough. But you have one last card to play."
    "她确实很顽强。但你还有最后一张牌可以打。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3606
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_663a0ce2:

    # you "You're reaching the limits of my patience."
    you "我的耐心已经到了极限。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3608
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_73bc77f0:

    # "Pushing her against the wall, you draw your knife, bringing it against her face. You push the blade up her left nostril."
    "你把她压在墙上,拿出刀子,把刀刃抵在她的左鼻孔上。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3610
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_2841c70e:

    # you "Do you like your nose, Sergeant? This is the first body part you're going to lose tonight, but not the last, if you don't talk."
    you "你喜欢你的鼻子吗,中士?这是你今晚要失去的第一个身体部位,但如果你不说话,这可不是最后一个。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3614
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_2a2b5660:

    # "You steel your resolve, giving her a hard look. She must not find out you're bluffing."
    "你下定决心,严厉地看着她。她没发现你是在虚张声势。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3618
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_bd61d45b:

    # "You hope she won't make you resort to this."
    "你希望不会被迫采取这种手段。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3622
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_d72c6372:

    # "You give her a mad look. It's obvious you'll do it, and worse."
    "你疯狂地看着她。很明显你会这么做,甚至更糟。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3624
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_5c05daf4:

    # "She looks at you in the eye, through tears of pain and rage. What she sees give her pause."
    "她通过痛苦和愤怒的泪水注视着你。她犹豫了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3626
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_95afb44e_2:

    # sergeant "..."
    sergeant "..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3628
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_fbb16fc1:

    # sergeant "Stop."
    sergeant "住手。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3630
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_d219fe2c:

    # "She cries."
    "她哭了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:3632
translate chinese_simplified c1_interrogate_menu_139adda0:

