    renza "女王陛下,很抱歉打扰您,但是...我们有个请求。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4622
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_f70383b5:

    # satella "Oh, you do? [emo_heart]"
    satella "哦,什么请求?[emo_heart]"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4624
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_64ea15bd:

    # "She bats her eyes innocently at you both."
    "她天真地眨着眼睛看着你们两个。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4626
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_12075eff:

    # satella "What is it? I'm so curious!!!"
    satella "是什么?我很好奇!!!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4628
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_968f0302:

    # you "Well, we're looking for a rare artefact..."
    you "嗯,我们正在寻找一件珍稀的文物..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4630
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_2d89221e:

    # renza "A crystal. Capable of recording a person's words, and playing it back..."
    renza "一个水晶。能够记录一个人的话语,并重放..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4632
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_ad96d844:

    # you "A voice crystal."
    you "一枚记录水晶。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4634
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_8ab0eba0:

    # satella "Uhm, I know that thing you're speaking of... I used to have a bunch lying around here to sing my favorite songs into..."
    satella "嗯,我知道你说的那件东西...以前这里到处都是,用来放我最喜欢的歌..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4636
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_7947624a:

    # "You try not to picture this."
    "你尽量不去想象这个画面。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4638
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_20c378f1:

    # satella "I broke most of them right off. They made my voice sound stupid."
    satella "可惜我把它们全都打坏了。它们让我的声音听起来很愚蠢。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4640
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_499b6cd8:

    # satella angry "AND IT DOESN'T!!!" with vpunch
    satella angry "但它并没有！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4642
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_64228032:

    # you "N... No, of course not!!!"
    you "当...当然!!!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4644
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_d1f071c7:

    # renza "Not at all!!!"
    renza "您的声音宛如天籁!!!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4646
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_52725d8f:

    # satella happy "Actually, you know how hard it is to find a good quality one? There's always some static, and I've tried to apply noise-reduction spells, but it never works very well... Also, people have a bad habit of speaking directly into the crystal. You shouldn't do that."
    satella happy "其实，你知道找到一个质量好的水晶有多难吗？总会有些杂音，我试过用降噪魔法，但效果都不太好……还有，人们有个坏习惯，就是直接对着水晶说话。你不应该这样做。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4649
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_54bc7aac:

    # satella angry "AND FOR FUCK'S SAKE PEOPLE, STOP SHOUTING INTO THE DAMN CRYSTAL! IT CAN HEAR YOU JUST FINE WITHOUT SHOUTING!!!" with vpunch
    satella angry "拜托各位，别再对着水晶大喊大叫了！不喊它也能听得很清楚！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4651
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_8aeef089:

    # you "We... We would never do that!"
    you "我们...我们绝对不会那样做!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4653
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_3418d55e:

    # renza "Oh no, we wouldn't!"
    renza "噢,我们不会的!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4655
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_ef759ee7:

    # satella happy "Really? Then, I guess I can lend you one."
    satella happy "真的吗？那我想我可以借给你一个。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4657
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_ed6898d9:

    # renza "Really?"
    renza "真的吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4659
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_1b91891a:

    # you "Really???"
    you "真的???"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4661
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_acf1e114:

    # satella "Really."
    satella "一言既出死马难追。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4663
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_510536e1:

    # "You blow a sigh of relief."
    "你长长地舒了口气。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4665
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_9f9cdd26:

    # "Finally, things are starting to look up."
    "终于,事情开始向好的方向发展了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4667
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_54b303fa:

    # satella "But of course, you will have to repay us, a favor for a favor..."
    satella "但是,这可不是免费的。一个人情换一个人情......"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4669
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_1b19a16f:

    # "You knew it. You just knew this was coming."
    "你知道的。你就知道这事儿会发生。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4671
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_2e43594a:

    # satella "My new friend [MC.name] here will be in my debt."
    satella "我新结识的朋友[MC.name]你欠我一个人情。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4673
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_ccd7c73b:

    # you "*cough* Err, me? Well, this is as much a favor for Renza as it is for me, you know..."
    you "*咳嗽*呃,我?嗯,伦萨的人情不也一样吗。你知道的..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4675
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_40cca837:

    # satella angry "{b}YOU{/b} WILL BE IN MY DEBT, OK!!!" with vpunch
    satella angry "{b}你一定会欠我一个人情的，明白吗！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4677
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_63021662:

    # renza "Of course he will!"
    renza "当然是的!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4679
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_f67967bf:

    # you "Uh... Understood..."
    you "呃...我明白了..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4681
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_426c336e:

    # you "So what... What do you want me to do?"
    you "那么...你想让我做什么?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4683
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_a62bd1f8:

    # satella happy "Oh, it's really no fun if I tell you now, is it? Teeheehee. We like to have our little secrets."
    satella happy "哦，现在告诉你就没意思了，对吧？嘻嘻嘻。我们喜欢保留一些小秘密。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4685
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_8040c233:

    # you "*gulp*"
    you "*咽口水*"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4687
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_da33183e:

    # satella "I'll let you know when it's time."
    satella "到时候我会告诉你的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4689
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_029b710d:

    # satella "Now, do you care for some cookies? I'll bake them myself..."
    satella "现在,想吃些曲奇吗?我亲手烤的..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4695
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_2a6e379e:

    # "After exchanging many uneasy pleasantries with Satella, you and Renza finally manage to take your leave."
    "在与萨特拉进行了许多不安的寒暄后,你和伦萨终于设法离开了那里。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4699
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_c83e1e38:

    # you "Phew... I thought we'd never make it out of there."
    you "呼...我还以为我们永远也出不来了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4701
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_10000677:

    # renza "Tell me about it. At least I'm not the one who made a pact with a teenage demon..."
    renza "还好。反正不是我和魔鬼少女签订协议..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4703
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_92c9eb82:

    # you "What???" with vpunch
    you "什么？？？" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4705
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_c8d5d5c2:

    # renza "Uh, nothing! Anyway, we have the crystal now. We can set the next step of our plan in motion. Here's what I want you to do..."
    renza "呃,没什么!不过,我们现在有水晶了。我们可以开始实施下一步计划了。我想让你这样做..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4713
translate chinese_simplified c1_satella_intro_f8551443:

    # "Go to the {b}watchtower{/b} and confront the infamous captain of the city guard."
    "去{b}瞭望塔{/b},会见那个臭名昭著的上尉。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4730
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_88e47283:

    # "Early in the morning, you head towards the Guard watchtower, grumbling about the wicked ways of women."
    "一大早,你就朝着瞭望塔走去,嘀咕着女人的恶劣行径。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4732
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_b74a8837:

    # you "How come I can never say no to a beautiful woman? *sigh*"
    you "为什么我总是无法拒绝美丽的女人?*叹息*"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4734
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_789ab4cd:

    # "You are not sure about Renza's plan, but you agreed to carry it out anyway."
    "你并不知道伦萨计划的全貌,但还是同意去执行命令。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4736
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_34501a15:

    # "You had your own reasons."
    "你有自己的原因。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4745
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_cf23aca5:

    # you "I worked my ass off... Well, the girls' asses off, to get that money."
    you "我可是费了九牛二虎之力...好吧,是女孩们费了九牛二虎之力,才攒了这么多钱。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4747
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_6e302808:

    # you "It is mine by right, and I will get it back."
    you "那钱是我的,谁也别想抢走。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4753
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_7c2e9962:

    # you "No one crosses me and lives to tell the tale."
    you "没人能从我这占到便宜。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4755
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_418974d1:

    # you "I'll get that captain. And when I'm done, I'll take care of Kosmo..."
    you "我会把上尉拉下马。事后,我还要去处理科斯莫..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4761
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_bad583ab:

    # you "The city guard is a menace, not just to myself but to all the slums' citizens."
    you "军队对我来说是个很大的麻烦,不仅对我,对所有贫民窟居民都是如此。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4763
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_11620197:

    # you "But today, I'm going to stop this. For justice!"
    you "但今天,我要阻止他们。为了正义!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4767
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_301ac8bd:

    # you "I have no idea why I agreed to this, but I don't care. I love risking it all on a whim!"
    you "我也不知道为什么会同意这么做,不过无所谓。车到山前必有路!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4769
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_8a9c4dc8:

    # you "And it looks like it's gonna be a fun ride..."
    you "看起来这会很有意思..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4780
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_49cbc65c:

    # "When you reach the gates, the lieutenant is already there waiting for you."
    "当你到达军营大门时,中尉已经在那里等你了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4782
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_41f067b9:

    # "She barely acknowledges you, not to arise suspicion, but she seems nervous."
    "她似乎有些紧张,但只是轻微地对你点了点头,以免引起怀疑。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4784
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_c13cd8f0:

    # "She whispers as you pass her by."
    "当你经过她身边时,她轻声耳语道。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4786
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_67b813e6:

    # lieutenant "The captain got the letter. It seems to be going along as planned."
    lieutenant "上尉收到了那封信。看来一切都在按计划进行。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4788
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_b71e5571:

    # lieutenant "A guard will take you upstairs. Good..."
    lieutenant "一名守卫会带你上楼。Good..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4792
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_daa7a8f7:

    # "You do not hear her last word. It must have been 'luck'. Or it could have been 'riddance', you're just not sure which."
    "你没有听清她最后说了什么。可能是\"Good luck祝你好运\"。也可能是\"Goodbye 永别了\",你不太确定。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4796
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_beb19c9e:

    # guard "Halt! State your name and business, citizen."
    guard "停下!报上你的名字和来意,贱民。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4798
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_96a5176d:

    # you "I am [MC.name]. I requested an audience with Captain Farah."
    you "我是[MC.name]。我请求与法拉上尉会面。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4800
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_5233a746:

    # guard "..."
    guard "..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4802
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_eb22b676:

    # guard "Yes, I can see that you did, and it has been granted. I will take you to the captain office."
    guard "是的,你确实有预约。我会带你去上尉的办公室。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4806
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_e3ecd226:

    # "You climb up to the very top of the tower, through a narrow circular staircase."
    "你沿着狭窄的旋转楼梯一直爬到塔楼顶部，魔法电梯只给大人物使用。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4808
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_0e59fb09:

    # "You can't help but think that should things turn sour, escaping will be very tricky..."
    "你不禁想,如果情况变糟,你很难从这里逃出去..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4810
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_240c0768:

    # "You also reflect on what you know about the captain. All the stories you've heard have been quite unnerving. Such a power-hungry, malevolent being..."
    "你反复思考你所知道的情报。你听说的所有故事都让人感到不安。她贪恋权力,如此邪恶..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4812
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_f2d5a8cc:

    # guard "This is the captain's quarters. You may enter, I will wait for you here. You have twenty minutes."
    guard "这里是上尉的办公室。你可以进去了,我会在这里等你。你有20分钟的时间。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4814
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_653c51fe:

    # "That's it. You get ready to stare into the ugly face of evil."
    "好了,你准备好面对邪恶的丑陋面孔了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4820
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_678806b4:

    # captain_voice "Yes?"
    captain_voice "什么事?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4824
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_ca5a2f7d:

    # "You enter the room. The guard closes the door behind you."
    "你走进房间,士兵关上了门。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4828
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_bf8ff279:

    # you "Captain Farah?"
    you "法拉上尉?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4838
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_e1911bb5:

    # captain "Yes? It's me."
    captain "是的,就是我。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4840
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_1ce09e51:

    # you "B... B..."
    you "好...好..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4849
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_47013b27:

    # you "Boobs!"
    you "好大的奶子!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4851
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_0ca23b17:

    # "Wow! You never expected this. The captain is a beautiful woman!"
    "哇!你从未想过,上尉竟是一位美丽的女性!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4853
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_d8e73848:

    # captain "I beg your pardon?"
    captain "不好意思?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4855
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_3525f086:

    # "She crosses the room towards you. Her every step makes her large tits bounce up and down."
    "她向你走来,每一步都让她丰满的双乳上下摆动。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4864
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_0b6b6d0a:

    # you "*sweat*"
    you "*汗水*"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4866
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_55afd508:

    # captain "Are you ok, citizen? You look feverish. And, uh... It looks like you're drooling."
    captain "你还好吗,先生?你看起来有些虚弱,而且...嘴角在流口水。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4868
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_ec685c31:

    # you "Me? Oh, uh, sorry my lady."
    you "我?噢,对不起,尊贵的女士。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4870
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_53ac4806:

    # "You try to pull yourself together and keep your eyes level with her face."
    "你努力保持冷静,将目光集中在她的脸上。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4872
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_fbcc6c62:

    # "Doing so, you can't help but notice that her womanly shapes are nicely complemented by her beautiful face. She has large, clear eyes. What a babe!"
    "但这样做的时候,你注意到她那娇柔的身材与美丽的面容完美结合。她有一双宝石般的眼睛。真漂亮啊!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4874
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_8040c233:

    # you "*gulp*"
    you "*咽口水*"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4876
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_07831a3e:

    # you "I... I am [MC.name] the merchant. I requested an audience because..."
    you "我...我是商人[MC.name]。我请求这次会面是因为..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4880
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_f4f12212:

    # captain "Yes, I know why you're here. I got a letter from my subordinate."
    captain "是的,我知道你为什么来。我收到了你的的来信。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4882
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_58919726:

    # you "Ah... Good."
    you "啊...是吗。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4884
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_fb8f1867:

    # captain "What you're asking for can be done... But it will be costly."
    captain "你所要求的事可以办到...但代价可不小。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4886
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_9ccfcafb:

    # captain "You see, taking someone out inside the city is more complicated than getting rid of some riffraff in the slums."
    captain "你知道,在城里除掉某人比在贫民窟处理要麻烦的多。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4888
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_2ba00675:

    # captain "Here in the slums, I have complete dominion. I can have anyone arrested or killed on short notice."
    captain "在贫民窟里,我有绝对的统治权。我可以让任何人被逮捕或被杀。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4890
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_95f38428:

    # captain "But in the city, I must grease some hands, make sure some folks look the other way when necessary..."
    captain "但在城里,我必须打点好关系,确保到时候上面睁一只眼闭一只眼..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4892
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_c2413cf1:

    # you "Is that so..."
    you "理应如此..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4894
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_52c5a2c7:

    # captain "So I can only do it for... Ten thousand denars. Take it or leave it."
    captain "所以你得付我....一万金币。接受还是拒绝?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4896
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_0fb2a0c7:

    # "She quoted the enormous sum matter-of-factly, awaiting for your reaction. You pretend not to be shocked by the outrageous amount."
    "她平淡地报出了巨额开价,等待着你的反应。你装作没有被这离谱的价格震惊。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4898
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_461befc2:

    # you "You are asking for a lot... But I can afford it."
    you "真是狮子大开口...不过我负担得起。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4901
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_35c0f434:

    # you "Restoring my honor is more important to me than money."
    you "恢复我的荣誉对我来说比金钱更重要。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4904
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_13190960:

    # you "I can't let myself be outsmarted by a petty schemer from the city."
    you "我不能让自己被城里的小丑愚弄。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4907
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_41338e03:

    # you "It's an investment. I will recoup it once I take over this man's business."
    you "而且这是笔投资。一旦我接管了他的产业,我就能把钱再挣回来。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4909
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_b27f9008:

    # captain "Oh, really?"
    captain "哦,是么?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4911
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_5e5b2cc0:

    # "She takes a skeptical look at your attire and demeanor."
    "她怀疑地打量着你的装扮和神态。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4913
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_8ebe52de:

    # captain "Forgive me, Master [MC.name], but you look a little young and inexperienced to be as wealthy as you claim to be..."
    captain "请原谅我,[MC.name]老板,但你看起来还太嫩了,你真的有这么多钱..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4915
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_9f446804:

    # captain "By the looks of you, I would take you for an adventurer who just arrived in town."
    captain "你这样的打扮,更像是刚来到这个城市的冒险者。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4917
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_f8d29e50:

    # "Her tone becomes overtly suspicious."
    "她的语气变得非常尖锐。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4919
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_68693418:

    # captain "And why would a wealthy individual such as yourself feel the need to open a small, shabby brothel in the slums, of all places?"
    captain "作为一个自称富有的人,你为什么要在贫民窟开一家小小肮脏的青楼呢?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4921
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_a66ad430:

    # captain "Something doesn't add up."
    captain "这说不通。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4923
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_dae0ec55:

    # you "..."
    you "..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4925
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_d83ba17e:

    # "She frowns."
    "她皱眉。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4927
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_c2343252:

    # you "You're right."
    you "你说得对。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4931
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_bdc354c1:

    # captain "What?"
    captain "什么?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4933
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_4f64b934:

    # you "I wasn't born into money. I'm an adventurer, and I only recently came in town."
    you "我不是出生在富裕家庭。我是个冒险者,最近才来到这个城市。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4935
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_8f10689c:

    # captain "So, you have been wasting my time, then..."
    captain "所以,你在浪费我的时间..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4937
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_0dc037a5:

    # "The threat in her voice is razor-sharp. But you keep talking."
    "她的语气里充满了愤怒。但你继续说下去。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4939
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_fdcc4312:

    # you "I have come to Zan to meet my uncle, a rich banker from the guild."
    you "我来泽恩是为了见我在公会里富有的叔叔。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4941
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_59ec2c20:

    # you "He told me to open a business, to prove that I could be a competent manager... So that one day, I could take over his loan-making business."
    you "他告诉我会让我接手企业,但得先证明我能胜任管理工作...这样有一天,我就可以接手他的高利贷业务。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4943
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_c50a233a:

    # captain "Did he, now..."
    captain "是这样吗..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4945
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_802d067e:

    # you "Yes. So that's why I opened a small brothel in the slums, using nothing but my own money. However..."
    you "是的。所以我就用自己的钱在贫民窟开了一家青楼。不过..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4947
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_bdc354c1_1:

    # captain "What?"
    captain "什么?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4949
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_14d8fd73:

    # "She is losing patience."
    "她已经失去耐心了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4951
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_a7e24848:

    # you "However, my uncle passed away last week, leaving me as his sole heir."
    you "不过,我的叔叔上周已经去世了,我是他唯一的法定继承人。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4953
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_e2eed065:

    # you "I didn't have time to prove my worth as a manager... But I inherited a large amount of money, and I intend to put it to good use."
    you "我来不及证明自己是个称职的管理者...但是我继承了一大笔钱,我打算好好利用它。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4955
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_eb54a04b:

    # captain "..."
    captain "..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4957
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_bfbb68c2:

    # captain "Well, that is a nice story. And I suppose you can back it up with proof?"
    captain "好吧,这确实是个不错的故事。不过你有什么证据?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4959
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_906a2155:

    # you "Of course."
    you "当然。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4961
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_b295548d:

    # "You take out the forged documents that Renza made and hand them to the captain."
    "你拿出了伦萨伪造的文件,递给了上尉。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4963
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_eb54a04b_1:

    # captain "..."
    captain "..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4965
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_3e40f82f:

    # "You hope fervently that Renza is as good a forger as she said she was."
    "希望伦萨的伪造功夫够好。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4967
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_6964c6e6:

    # captain "........."
    captain "…………"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4969
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_c2cebc67:

    # captain "It appears to be in order. Why, [MC.name], my good man, it seems that you have struck gold!"
    captain "没什么问题。我亲爱的[MC.name],看来天上掉馅饼了!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4971
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_723aac37:

    # you "Well, my uncle passed away, and all..."
    you "嗯,但我叔叔去世了,所以..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4973
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_0f363968:

    # captain "So your uncle croaked, big deal... You barely knew him anyway! But with that kind of money, you can do great things..."
    captain "反正他都死了,别管他了...反正你也不太熟。但有了这么多钱,你可以成就一番事业..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4975
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_4ad7620e:

    # you "Well, sure..."
    you "那是当然..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4977
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_5ff4201c:

    # captain "I have a feeling you and I are going to be fast friends. *wolfish smile*"
    captain "我感觉我们会成为好朋友的。*露出狼一样的笑容*"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4979
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_015aa2a5:

    # "As she says that, she leans closer to you, giving you a seductive look."
    "当她这么说的时候,她凑近了你,给了你抛一个诱惑的媚眼。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4981
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_313a921c:

    # "You are getting hard just looking into her big green eyes... And the cleavage below."
    "你光是看着她那双绿色的大眼睛就已经兴奋不已...还有那胸口的山谷。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4991
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_366f098c:

    # you "You... Err... Hem... Haven't you got money of your own, anyway?"
    you "你...唔...那么,难道你很缺钱吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4995
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_ff401f49:

    # captain "Oh, I do, my dear, I do! But I can always use more. Let me show you something."
    captain "噢,我当然缺,亲爱的!我需要更多金钱。让我给你看点宝贝。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:4997
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_7e92dfc5:

    # "Turning around, she gestures softly for you to follow her."
    "她转过身,向你做了个手势,示意你跟上。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5001
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_d06cfdb2:

    # "You take a good look at her well-rounded buttocks as she leads you to the back of the room."
    "当她带路时,你仔细地看着她丰满的臀部。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5003
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_1ab22541:

    # "There, she opens a large, steel door with three different locks."
    "到那里,她打开了一扇大大的钢制门,上面有三个不同的锁。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5009
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_669fe383:

    # captain "Tadaa!!!"
    captain "哒哒!!!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5011
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_231a57fd:

    # you "Wow... What is this place?"
    you "哇...这是什么地方?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5013
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_56aea05b:

    # captain "This is the vault, where I keep the fruits of the city guard's labor."
    captain "这就是我的秘密金库。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5015
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_451fc5e7:

    # you "The city taxes, you mean?"
    you "税收也在这里面?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5019
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_fa02a33d:

    # captain "Ahahah! You could call it that... All the money that the wretches in the slums save patiently, denar by denar..."
    captain "啊哈哈!可以这么说...所有那些活在贫民窟中的可怜人辛苦攒下的钱,一点一点..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5021
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_96c9a4e6:

    # captain "The guards relieve them of their gold and send it all to me! ME!"
    captain "我的手下会把他们的金钱榨干,全都送到我这里!我这里!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5023
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_1c537d6e:

    # "The glint of greed in her eyes has turned into a mad, feverish spark."
    "她眼中贪婪的光芒已变成狂热的火花。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5025
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_e17bcebf:

    # captain "Taxes, fines, extortion, torture, I don't care how my men do it, as long as it all ends up here, in my vault!"
    captain "税收、罚款、勒索、折磨,我不在乎我的手下是如何做的,只要最后钱能进我的金库!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5027
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_ea424b3e:

    # you "So you get to keep the gold..."
    you "所以这些金钱都归你所有..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5029
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_65adf6a7:

    # captain "And not just the gold! Look around you! I get the gems, the jewels, the family heirlooms, everything!"
    captain "不仅仅是金钱!看看你四周!宝石、珠宝、遗产,所有的一切都归我所有!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5031
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_63fcb22a:

    # captain "And believe me, even the poorest beggar has something of value... You just have to beat him hard enough until he coughs it up. And if he doesn't... Well, no one will miss him, anyway."
    captain "相信我,就连最穷的乞丐也有值钱的东西...你只需要狠狠地打他,直到他吐出来为止。如果他不吐出来...反正也没人会想念他。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5036
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_51e6eb5f:

    # captain "I am the queen of the outer city, now. The wretches in the slums are my subjects, working their asses off so that I can thrive!"
    captain "现在我就是外城的女皇。贫民窟里的可怜虫都是我的臣民,他们要拼命工作,才让我能过上好日子!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5038
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_a40e4279:

    # you "But what do you do with all this money???"
    you "可是存这么多钱又有什么用呢???"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5040
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_a85ff1c2:

    # captain "Oh, come on! As a fellow rich person, you should understand this: you {i}always{/i} need more money."
    captain "哦,拜托!作为一个富人,你应该能理解这一点:你{i}永远{/i}需要更多的钱。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5042
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_10f29115:

    # you "But with all these riches, you can already afford a lavish lifestyle..."
    you "但是有了这些钱,你已经能过上奢侈的生活了..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5044
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_d4ee6b5b:

    # captain "Oh, but I have expensive tastes! Do you think taking care of such a magnificient body comes cheap?"
    captain "啊,我的消费水平可不低!难道你以为保养这样漂亮的身材会很便宜吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5046
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_e93cdcc3:

    # "She flaunts her assets right in front of your nose. You swallow hard and try to stay on topic."
    "她毫不掩饰地炫耀着自己的资产。你咽了口唾沫,努力保持话题。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5048
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_e6bfbc31:

    # captain "Every day, I take a bath in a pool of the finest slave milk. I get five massages a day, by the best practitioners in the city. My hair is getting done every morning by my personal stylist. I also get a daily magic facial at the enchanted spa, and manicure at the fairy grove..."
    captain "每天我都要用上等牛奶在浴缸里沐浴。每天要做5次按摩,由最顶级的按摩技师来做。每天早上都要由我的个人造型师打理头发。我还要在魔法水疗中心做日常补水美容,在仙女花园里做美甲..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5052
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_faf4241c:

    # captain "I also like jewels, of course. I have thousands of them! Oh, and fine clothes and lingerie... Do you know how much they charge for Hokoman silk? The sky's the limit!"
    captain "当然,我也喜欢珠宝。我拥有成千上万颗宝石!还有上好的衣服和内衣...你知道天蚕丝要多少钱吗?无上限!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5055
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_fc055125:

    # captain "And SHOES, of course. I have so many shoes!!! But I can never get enough... Shoes..."
    captain "还有鞋子,当然。我有那么多鞋子!!!但我永远都不够...鞋子..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5057
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_ae79b2f2:

    # captain "I love SHOES!!!" with vpunch
    captain "我爱鞋子！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5059
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_31fe1d97:

    # you "Wow."
    you "哇。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5063
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_636ea033:

    # captain "There, you've done it. Now I just have to buy a fine pair of glass slippers first thing in the morning. *sigh*"
    captain "好了,你说完了。现在我就要去买一双漂亮的水晶鞋。*叹气*"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5065
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_b871d1b5:

    # you "I see. Looks like you have lots of legitimate uses for this gold."
    you "我明白了。看来你确实有很多地方需要花钱。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5067
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_978c78ea:

    # captain "Exactly!"
    captain "正是如此!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5069
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_34fcddb0:

    # you "But what I don't get is... This is technically tax money. Aren't you supposed to give it back to the city, or the crown?"
    you "但我不明白的是...这些钱法律上来说是税收。你不应该把钱上交给国库吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5073
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_ad46d7fa:

    # captain "Hahaha!!! This is a clever observation. But I have a deal... I have a powerful patron, someone high up inside the palace."
    captain "哈哈哈!!!你很敏锐。但我有一后台...我有一位势力很大的后台,在宫里地位很高。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5075
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_f76c3839:

    # captain "No one can touch me. They need someone to be in charge of the slums, as it serves their own ends in many ways. So they don't care if I keep the money, as long as I have the slums under control."
    captain "没人能碰我。他们需要有人来管理贫民窟,因为这符合他们自己的利益。所以只要我能控制好贫民窟,他们是不会管我如何处置这些钱的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5078
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_4d8c38c5:

    # you "They don't care about the money? What about the people of the slums?"
    you "他们不在乎钱?那贫民窟的居民呢?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5082
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_3259f7e8:

    # captain "Do you seriously think anyone at court is going to care about improving the life of the rabble in the slums? What are they gonna do, build roads and bridges? Please."
    captain "你认真以为朝廷里会有人关心贫民窟居民的生活吗?他们打算要修路架桥?别开玩笑了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5085
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_84da2010:

    # captain "As far as they're concerned, I can spend all the tax money on clothes and shoes, and work the peons in the slums until they all starve. There are plenty more where they're coming from."
    captain "在他们看来,我可以把所有税款都花在衣服和鞋子上,让贫民窟的平民工作到死也无所谓。反正还有更多人可以取代他们。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5088
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_ff40dd2e:

    # captain "...And that suits me just fine."
    captain "...这正合我意。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5090
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_5b23fb78:

    # you "Wow, you're really something..."
    you "哇,你真是个了不起的人..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5097
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_277a6f2f:

    # captain "Anyway, I will take care of your little problem. Your ten thousand denars will fit nicely in this vase next to my bed!"
    captain "无论如何,我会解决你的小麻烦。你那一万枚金币会很安稳地睡在我床头柜旁边的这个花瓶里!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5101
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_6441c0ac:

    # captain "I will be able to let the gold run through my well-manicured hands for relaxation... Mmmmh..."
    captain "我会让金币在我的掌间流淌,这样会让我感到放松....嗯......."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5103
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_829992d5:

    # you "Err, sure, whatever. So we have a deal."
    you "呃,好吧,随便你。那么我们达成协议了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5105
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_5c69e687:

    # captain "When can you give me the gold?"
    captain "什么时候可以付钱?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5107
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_fd1106ab:

    # "She cannot hide her impatience."
    "她无法掩饰她的急不可待。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5109
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_85a4642b:

    # you "Well, let us arrange an exchange soon... In a public place."
    you "好吧,让我们尽快安排一次交易....在一个公共场所。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5113
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_e78bb06c:

    # captain "A public place, uh? I see, you don't trust me... I am pained."
    captain "公共场所,嗯?我懂了,你不相信我....我伤心了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5115
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_ceef165b:

    # "She makes a show of having her feelings hurt."
    "她装出一副受伤的样子。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5119
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_9a9f6739:

    # captain "Ah, Master [MC.name], and here I thought we were such good friends! But fine, we'll do it your way, if we must."
    captain "啊,[MC.name]大人,我还以为我们是亲密的朋友!不过没关系,既然你坚持,我们就按你的方式来吧。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5121
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_00a3cc5c:

    # you "Good."
    you "好的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5123
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_667d99ad:

    # captain "Tomorrow is execution day. I will be overseeing the executions myself, with high ranking officials from the city."
    captain "明天是行刑日。我自己亲自监督处决,还有来自城里的高官。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5125
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_0b3b2580:

    # captain "I will get you an invitation to the tribune. We can talk safely during the morning hangings... Not many people will be paying attention."
    captain "我会给你一张参加审判的邀请函。我们可以在早上的绞刑时间里安全地谈话....那时很少有人会注意到我们。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5127
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_0111ff70:

    # you "Perfect."
    you "太棒了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5129
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_07723ff9:

    # captain "Good. Now, go."
    captain "好的。现在,你可以走了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5131
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_fbfd7954:

    # captain "And of course, keep everything you've seen here to yourself... No one would believe you if you tried to betray me, anyway. Are we clear?"
    captain "当然,你在这里看到的一切都要保密....不过就算你想背叛我,也没人会相信你。你明白吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5133
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_81c9474c:

    # you "Crystal clear. *smile*"
    you "完全明白。*微笑*"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5135
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_ac1b380c:

    # captain "Good. Farewell now, my dear rich bachelor!"
    captain "好的。再见了,我亲爱的黄金单身汉!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5137
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_e7bd626e:

    # "She blows you a kiss, before shutting the door to your face."
    "她在关门前冲你吹了个飞吻。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5143
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_14197e94:

    # "Reaching into your pocket as you get down the stairs, you feel the reassuring warmth of the voice crystal."
    "当你走下楼梯时,你感到口袋里有水晶的在发热。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5145
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_af874696:

    # "You stop the recording spell by brushing off the appropriate rune, and put the stone back into your jacket."
    "你用手指拂过合适的符文来停止录音,然后把水晶放回夹克内。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5154
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_2f0056ac:

    # "As you walk away from the tower, you notice a dark shadow, standing near a tree."
    "当你走出塔楼时,你注意到一个黑色的身影,站在一棵树旁。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5156
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_b9c1b730:

    # you "Renza..."
    you "伦萨...."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5164
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_7ce77426:

    # renza "Hi, [MC.name]."
    renza "嗨,[MC.name]。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5166
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_552655b6:

    # renza "How did it go?"
    renza "进展如何?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5168
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_4e29bda3:

    # "She is trying hard to hide the anxiety in her voice."
    "她正竭力掩饰声音中的焦虑。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5170
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_20e12746:

    # you "As well as it could, I suppose. She swallowed the bait."
    you "十分顺利。她上当了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5172
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_d3fcadc0:

    # renza "Oh, that's a relief... And the recording? You have it?"
    renza "哦,太好了....录音呢?你有吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5174
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_af53e9d6:

    # you "I do... Good thing she didn't know I was wearing a Wyer."
    you "有的....幸好她不知道我带着这个。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5176
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_6abb5c2b:

    # renza "Perfect! [MC.name], you've been an amazing help..."
    renza "[MC.name],你太棒了,真是帮了大忙...."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5178
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_41bcc05d:

    # you "Hehe... Don't make me blush."
    you "呵呵....别让我脸红。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5180
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_8631c3f5:

    # renza "We can now move on to the next phase of our plan... Did she agree to meet you in public?"
    renza "我们现在可以进入计划的下一阶段了....她同意在公共场合见你吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5182
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_c5142ecc:

    # you "Yes. Tomorrow, at the gallows, for execution day."
    you "是的。明天,在绞刑台,执行死刑。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5184
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_1d57c41b:

    # renza "Oh, that's more than perfect... Many big shots will be there. We can finally fulfill our objective, and get rid of the captain!"
    renza "噢,这比我想象的还要完美......那里会有很多大人物。我们终于可以完成目标,除掉上尉了!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5186
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_0a41e4f7:

    # renza "Are you ready for this?"
    renza "你准备好了吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5189
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_fc084977:

    # you "I'm ready..." nointeract
    you "我准备好了……" nointeract

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5196
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_cd13d2ab:

    # you "You know I can't refuse you anything, Renza."
    you "你知道我愿意为你付出一切,伦萨。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5198
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_a546598b:

    # "She blushes."
    "她脸红了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5200
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_8c4cad27:

    # renza "Oh, [MC.name]... Was that a compliment? Anyway, let's get ready!"
    renza "噢,[MC.name]......那是在夸奖我吗?不管了,我们开始准备吧!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5205
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_0c0c60de:

    # you "I'm ready to do the right thing."
    you "我已经准备好做正确的事了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5207
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_76337e8c:

    # "She looks a bit taken aback."
    "她似乎有些受到打击。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5209
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_a27a2b15:

    # renza "Uh, yeah, sure. Whatever you call it. Now, get ready."
    renza "呃,是的,当然。不管你怎么说。现在,做好准备吧。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5214
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_3b238af4:

    # you "I'm ready to do what it takes to get my fucking money back."
    you "我已经准备好去拿回我那该死的钱了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5216
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_3e9655e7:

    # "She smiles."
    "她微笑着。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5218
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_e5b662ae:

    # renza "Always the pragmatist. Very well then, get yourself ready."
    renza "你一如既往地实在。很好,那就做好准备吧。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5223
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_a2c066db:

    # you "I'm ready! Let's show those guard punks not to cross us!"
    you "我已经准备好了!让我们来教训那些臭军阀,别惹我们!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5225
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_0bc7db9d:

    # "She laughs."
    "她大笑起来。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5227
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_f3210f93:

    # "That's the spirit! Let no one get between you and your sweet revenge. Let's go!"
    "那就对了!不要让任何人阻挡你复仇的道路。走吧!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5234
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_64f5a087:

    # you "I'm ready to lie and manipulate people until I get my way."
    you "我已经准备好欺骗和操纵人们,直到达到我的目的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5236
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_4fa15f6d:

    # "She laughs nervously."
    "她勉强挤出笑容。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5238
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_72509420:

    # renza "Wow, how ruthless! Sometimes you scare even me, [MC.name]. Let's get ready!"
    renza "哇,真是无情!有时连我都被你吓到了,[MC.name]。我们开始准备吧!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5250
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_9bb906dc:

    # "On the day of the public meeting, you make your way to the gallows."
    "在公众集会当天,你走向了绞刑台。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5252
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_e110da4b:

    # you "Damn, I'm nervous."
    you "该死,我好紧张。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5255
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_fcbf04f2:

    # you "I hate these cloak and dagger intrigues. I long for a good head-on fight."
    you "我讨厌阴谋诡计。我渴望一场正面对抗。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5257
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_dfb06f4f:

    # you "Usually, when I dabble into politics, I don't risk ending with a rope around my neck."
    you "通常,当我涉足政坛时,我可不想最后被绞死。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5259
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_162a2c91:

    # you "I'm a businessman. I like to have other people handle the dirty business, not me!"
    you "我是个商人。我更喜欢让别人去处理那些肮脏的事情,而不是我自己!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5263
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_5ea62798:

    # "You hear a commotion rip through the busy streets as you approach the plaza."
    "当你接近广场时,你听到了一阵骚动从繁忙的街道上传来。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5265
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_9f7a97dd:

    # roz "Have you seen this woman? You, have you seen her?"
    roz "你有看到这个女人吗?你,你有看到她吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5267
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_99f7eb77:

    # roz "Answer me!" with vpunch
    roz "回答我！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5271
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_c316ee80:

    # roz "You! Little man! I know you from somewhere!"
    roz "你!小伙子!我好像在哪里见过你!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5273
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_f1814905:

    # "It's Roz, the guard who was accompanying Maya when she rescued you."
    "是罗兹,那个随玛雅一起救你的卫兵。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5275
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_fd4125d2:

    # you "Oh, we might have met... I'm not sure..."
    you "噢,我们好像见过......我也记不太清了..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5277
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_b19bf57d:

    # roz "We did! Me and my mate Maya, we saved your hide back there, when you were attacked by thugs!"
    roz "我们救了你!我和我的上司玛雅,当你被暴徒袭击的时候,我们救了你一命!"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5279
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_35759eca:

    # you "Uhm, maybe, my memory is a little fuzzy..."
    you "呃,也许吧,我记忆有点模糊..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5281
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_b032c840:

    # roz "Listen!" with vpunch
    roz "听！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5283
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_1d5e02fc:

    # roz "Maya is missing, I've been searching for her high and low."
    roz "玛雅失踪了,我到处寻找她。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5285
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_bf2f598f:

    # roz "Have you seen her anywhere?"
    roz "你有看见她吗?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5287
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_c9411119:

    # "You reflect that, at the moment, she's probably being gang-banged by a bunch of horny thieves. But you think it's best to keep it to yourself."
    "你默想,此刻她可能正被一帮色狼侵犯。但你觉得最好还是把这件事藏在心里。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5289
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_219f5989:

    # you "I'm really sorry, Roz. I have no idea where your friend is. But I'm sure, err, she's fine."
    you "对不起,罗兹。我完全不知道她的下落。但我相信,呃,她会没事的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5291
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_247f4fbc:

    # roz "Easy for you to say that!" with vpunch
    roz "你当然说得轻松！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5293
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_20089716:

    # "Roz desperately turns to other strangers in the street, repeating his questions."
    "罗兹绝望地转向街上的其他陌生人,重复着他的问题。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5295
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_83fb1b10:

    # roz "You, hey, you! Have you seen this woman? Blue hair, tanned skin..."
    roz "你,嘿,你!你有看见这个女孩吗?红色头发,洁白的肤色..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5299
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_ee5d7ca3:

    # "You smile a crooked smile."
    "你露出一个歪歪斜斜的微笑。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5301
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_0a01b209:

    # you "Poor bastard... Hehe..."
    you "可怜的家伙...哈哈..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5304
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_1bac5cfb:

    # maya "Hey, [MC.name]!" with vpunch
    maya "嘿，[MC.name]！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5308
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_7d7e323d:

    # roz "Maya! Don't go near that guy..."
    roz "玛雅!别靠近那个人..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5312
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_26cff245:

    # roz "Let me break his legs first!!!" with vpunch
    roz "让我先打断他的腿！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5314
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_08a801b0:

    # maya "Keep your cool, Roz. I told you he's not the one we have to worry about right now."
    maya "保持冷静,罗兹。我告诉过你,他不是我们要对付的人。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5316
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_95ad6926:

    # you "Maya! What are you doing here? I thought..."
    you "玛雅!你怎么在这里?我还以为..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5318
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_b8007fd2:

    # roz "You thought she was rotting in her cell, uh, you jackass!!!" with vpunch
    roz "你以为她会在牢房里腐烂吗，呃，你这个混蛋！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5320
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_bb704aba:

    # maya "Roz, shut it! Let me handle this."
    maya "罗兹,闭嘴!让我来处理这件事。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5322
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_22fdc4d9:

    # "The large warrior seethes with righteous anger, but reluctantly holds back."
    "这个强大的战士怀着正义的愤怒在沸腾,但勉强抑制住了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5325
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_2d317e54:

    # you "That's right, Roz. Be a good boy, stop tugging at your leash."
    you "就是这样,罗兹。乖乖的,不要再拉扯你的锁链了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5327
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_f383efb1:

    # "Roz gives you a murderous look."
    "罗兹向你投射出凶狠的目光。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5329
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_dad6b94a:

    # maya "Roz helped me escape from the thieves guild."
    maya "罗兹帮我逃脱了盗贼公会。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5331
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_902351ce:

    # maya "On the way out, we captured my jailer... That lecherous bastard. *angry*"
    maya "在逃出的路上,我们逮捕了我的看守...那些好色的混蛋。*愤怒*"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5333
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_1c6d8979:

    # maya "Anyway, Roz roughed him up a little, and he told us about the guild's plan. Exposing the captain, replacing her with the lieutenant... We know everything."
    maya "总之,罗兹打了他一顿,他告诉了我们公会的计划。揭露上尉,让中尉接任...我们知道了一切。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5336
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_f3b8f51b:

    # roz "That's right, scumbag! We know of your friends' little plan..."
    roz "没错,混蛋!我们知道你朋友的小计划..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5338
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_bc6cc456:

    # maya "Please. I am appealing to your conscience here. The captain is the devil you know, but you don't know what the thieves guild is capable of."
    maya "拜托。摸摸你的良心。上尉是你所知的恶人,但你不知道盗贼公会还能做出什么。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5340
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_8358b39a:

    # maya "They may be less brutal than the captain, but just as ruthless and greedy. The slums would be trading a master for another, and the people wouldn't be better off."
    maya "他们可能没有上尉那么残暴,但他们同样无情和贪婪。贫民窟会在一个主人换成另一个主人,百姓并不会好过。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5344
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_2dfaa7bf:

    # you "..." nointeract
    you "..." nointeract

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5349
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_77de7452:

    # you "You're right. The way the people of the slums have been treated so far is unacceptable. I'm not going to pass this opportunity to make things right."
    you "你说得对。至今为止,贫民窟居民的遭遇实在是令人无法接受。我不会放过这次改变现状的机会。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5355
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_dfb6745d:

    # you "You're dreaming. The slums are the way they are because that's how the world works. It's not the thieves' fault if money trumps all."
    you "你在做梦。贫民窟之所以如此,是因为这就是这个世界的运作方式。如果金钱决定一切,那么盗贼也没做错。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5357
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_4891eb98:

    # you "At least, the people of the slums will be robbed by just one gang instead of two."
    you "至少,贫民窟的人民只会被一个势力压榨,而不是两个。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5362
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_b7551b74:

    # you "I don't have to explain myself to you. I'll do whatever I want."
    you "我没必要向你解释。我会做任何我想做的事。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5364
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_6057b576:

    # roz "The hell you will!" with vpunch
    roz "你休想！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5366
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_3ac178b9:

    # maya "Please, listen. When the time comes, expose the lieutenant as a thief spy. Don't let her take over the Guard."
    maya "请听我说。当时机来临时,揭露中尉是个盗贼间谍。不要让她接管守卫。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5368
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_1fcb7c4c:

    # you "Look, I really don't have time for a lecture now..."
    you "听着,我现在真的没时间听你讲这些..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5370
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_4cf53e81:

    # maya "Think about it, please."
    maya "请仔细想想。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5372
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_18b1fdde:

    # you "I have to go."
    you "我得走了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5374
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_43410e2b:

    # maya "..."
    maya "..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5376
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_638762d9:

    # maya "All right. Go then."
    maya "好吧,那就走吧。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5378
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_9755ac10:

    # roz "Maya, you're not seriously..."
    roz "玛雅,你不会真的..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5380
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_686ee5dd:

    # maya "The die is cast. We'll be watching you, [MC.name]."
